  "description": "Introducing the VoltBike Bravo Core with its cutting-edge Bafang M600 Mid-Drive system featuring torque sensing technology. This powerful electric bike delivers an extremely natural riding experience, feeling just like a non-motorized bike but with the power to get you where you need to go. The VoltBike Bravo Core offers 120nm of torque, nearly double the rating of the regular Bravo e-bike. The latest edition of the Bravo Core comes upgraded with a 11-speed SRAM NX drivetrain for improved power transfer. Standard for the bike is a large 19.6Ah (with optional 25Ah upgrade) Li-ion battery with Samsung cells. Paired with powerful hydraulic brakes and large color LCD screen, Bravo Core offers some serious technology advancements. This nimble, lightweight e-bike is VoltBike's ultimate commuter ebike. Equipped with Maxxis Minnion DHF Tires 27.5x2.3\".",
